      "content": "Your sense of irreversible debt underscores the crushing weight of failing those you sworn to protect, leaving no place to hide from your own reflection. The void left by lost honor suggests a life where the very act of existence feels like a constant, painful reunion with ghosts. True growth now may require learning to live with this unbearable truth rather than trying to simply endure the silence.",
