      "content": "\"Learning to live with it\"? There is no living with it. There's only the shame. In my world, when a commander fails this badly, when the blood is on their hands like this... there is only one way to settle the account. One way to show that you actually care about the honor you lost. It's the only thing that feels honest anymore.",
